.claude/worktrees
keys
node_modules
# Scratch projects: the workspace the desktop app seeds from templates/basic on first launch,
# and whatever else gets tried out here. Each one is its own git repo full of generated art.
# The committed template lives in templates/, so nothing under examples/ needs to be tracked.
examples
dist
.turbo
.vndesktop
coverage
*.tsbuildinfo
# `pnpm lint` runs eslint with --cache, which writes this.
.eslintcache
*.tmp-*
# Bundled entry points the build scripts require() and delete; an aborted run leaves one behind.
.record-entry.cjs*
.cache-entry.cjs*
.keylinks-entry.cjs*
.keyaudit-entry.cjs*
# What the weekly key-docs audit proposes. It is an artifact and an issue body, never a commit.
key-instructions-review.md
# Packaging: the scratch project `scripts/package.desktop.mjs` assembles for a hoisted
# install, and the installers electron-builder writes out of it.
apps/desktop/.package
apps/desktop/release
.DS_Store
# The review-agent-transcripts skill remembers which project transcripts it has already read.
transcript-review-ledger.json
